.TH WERKMEISTER-RESTART 1 "" "werkmeister" "Werkmeister Manual"
.SH NAME
werkmeister\-restart \- Restart containers (use 'infra' for shared infra)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwerkmeister restart\fR [feature]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Useful after making code changes that hot\-reload doesn't pick up. If the feature doesn't have a slot, prints an error suggesting \fBwerkmeister up\fR instead.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBwerkmeister\fR(1)
